# UDM remote control targets for control-remote-udm.sh
#
# Format: host_or_ip [bind_ip]
# - host_or_ip: Target UDM hostname or IP address (required)
# - bind_ip: Source IP for SSH BindAddress (optional)
#
# Lines starting with # or empty are ignored.
# Username and password are prompted for each UDM.
#
# Copy to control-udms.conf (in repo root) and add your UDMs:
#   cp scripts/manage/control-udms.conf.example control-udms.conf
#
# Example entries:
# 192.168.1.100
# 192.168.1.101 192.168.50.1
# vpn-gateway.example.com
